Table:
| User | Assigned to | Priority |
|------|-------------|----------|
| Alice | Bob         | High    |
| Bob   | Carol       | Low     |

Paragraph with a few lines of normal text.
)";

    std::cout << markdownToHtml(mdText) << '\n';

    return 0;
}
```

